     A* CUSTRPT.PRTF -- printer file for the customer balance report.
     A* Columns 39-41 are the line, 42-44 the position. A blank line means
     A* "the same line as the field before", so each record here is one line.

     A          R HEADING                   SKIPB(1) SPACEA(2)
     A                                  1  2'CUSTOMER BALANCES'
     A                                  1 40'PAGE'
     A            PAGE           3S 0O  1 45PAGNBR EDTCDE(Z)
     A                                  2  2'NO.'
     A                                     8'NAME'
     A                                    32'BALANCE'

     A          R DETAIL
     A            CUSTNO         5S 0O     2EDTCDE(Z)
     A            NAME          20A  O     8
     A            BAL            9S 2O    28EDTCDE(J)

     A          R TOTAL                     SPACEB(2)
     A                                     8'TOTAL'
     A            TOT            9S 2O    28EDTCDE(J)
